OL,3,APrince William to attend King Harald's
OL,4,Afuneral in Norway
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince of Wales will attend the
OL,7,Ffuneral of King Harald V of Norway on
OL,8,FWednesday in Oslo, Buckingham Palace
OL,9,Fhas announced.
OL,11,FAlso going to the funeral, in a
OL,12,Fpersonal capacity, is Princess Anne,
OL,13,Fwho is godmother to Norway's new
OL,14,Fmonarch, King Haakon VIII.
OL,16,FThe late King Harald, a popular,
OL,17,Fmodernising figure who had been on the
OL,18,FNorwegian throne for 35 years, died
OL,19,Flast month at the age of 89.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
