OL,3,APrince William to attend King Harald's
OL,4,Afuneral in Norway
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal sources say Prince William's
OL,7,Fattendance, representing his father
OL,8,FKing Charles, follows the convention
OL,9,Fthat the monarch does not usually go to
OL,10,Fthe funeral of another head of state.
